{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1508711-aeon-jumpstart-quantum-entanglement","id":1508711,"title":"[Aeon] Jumpstart - Quantum Entanglement","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-17T22:59:20-07:00","id":1508711,"title":"[Aeon] Jumpstart - Quantum Entanglement","content":"So I prepare to run <b>Quantum Entanglement </b><b>jumpstart</b> for<b> TC Aeon. </b>I like a bit darker tone for this setting, so adventure seams working with that. But I read some reviews PCs are a bit disjointed as a group.<br /> <br /> I wonder - Maybe makes them all hired by Aeon Trinity Org to look into mysterious deaths on Luna be good starting point? <br /> <br /> I assume it would be only setting part of story - Paths and Connections of PCs will be intact. Is that only Aeon asked their home Psi Orders for help? <br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-18T05:04:34-07:00","id":1508735,"title":"","content":"PCs are disjointed as a group because they made them different to cover all kinds of ideas. If I were you, specially if I was planning to move forward with the campaign, to let the players create their characters and have a reason to be together.<br /> <br /> I like the idea of them being around for different reasons and joined together, it\u2019s good for a new group as they need to work together, not only the players, but also the characters. There is a bunch of hooks in the story and they give many suggestions on why things happen to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-18T18:10:34-07:00","id":1508800,"title":"","content":"I will probably mark PCs to be any Order they like - only in game backstory point that Aeon Trinity asked nicely their representative to Luna Park crime scene as 'things are bigger than it's seems'. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> With Aeon being like small but very influential country in UN, I suspect Psi Orders just answer it if it's not something very depleting their resources or counter to main objective - somehow to repay Aeon Trinity for world PR help when Psi Orders uncovered themselves in Sydney attack of 2106 at their accusations of beings Aberrants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-19-2023, 07:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{