d of Olympus. Attackers are mind controlled miners of deep levels, one of them is <b>dr. Emil Rochevaunt</b> in alter ego persona of his. </span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Mikael </b>is lone in deep tunnels, attacked by <b>Mother Maw</b>. He is slashed in the chest and acid burn on higher half of his body by digestive acids of Maw, monster preparing to eat him. </span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Emil Rochevaunt</b> in <b>Beaulac Clinic</b> has drugged and taken <b>Mikael</b> to tunnels, like two other missing psions before him. Emil do not remember actions of his alter ego.</span></li> </ol><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Is this correct read of stories murder, from end to beginning?</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-20T21:40:27-07:00","id":1515718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1508711-aeon-jumpstart-quantum-entanglement?p=1515525#post1515525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do we have official portraits for <b>Niko Karev</b>, <b>Anna White,</b> <b>M</b><b>ikael Gorskovski</b> and <b>Dian Baez</b> to show to players? \ud83e\udd14 I didn't seen them in jumpstart 